ri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75295893_1122035958805707_3976827415305179869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bdPy0E52VWEQ7kNvwGB-5KM&_nc_oc=AdowGLoY6SNCb8VU2JVy-u2LlovOEsINv0S_l6yUME4VXJuUgqQfxnzC8dsI4EhMLr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7OURSK105tF5RR2843x-dPnd0G6B4q7S_2itPT9IiKNw&oe=6A1D9D81"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO3.png", "id": "285314937333520", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035431_285314940666853_7917901485208087798_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qLVVyazgM2UQ7kNvwEOczI2&_nc_oc=AdpuW85jMXmvHzNobhGj2hINK--xeUeWOZtPjhU6gVwyd8etS1ec_u9EY2C0asNKxeA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6ltGwc6YdN1WNXdW_U0MqojKfNQ_JeC1JrmuVdk53jew&oe=6A1D8EE6"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO5.png", "id": "381136241036217", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982584_381136244369550_483176816840528973_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UACzmIsd5bEQ7kNvwHTeYNl&_nc_oc=AdrLMSHMQS74XhFxcLB1nfgFP-w0xgj_Uzedy_2lHKS73qEOFGMP2FktyIHd7GEhx24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6mclhUmyWgrJVgb0lzTyMEKRqRDsOWChlsICxER07FXw&oe=6A1D9F7A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_VROO6.png", "id": "2169394943393371", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2169394946726704_833013698734162480_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ALo2z00mj0cQ7kNvwEhf6eN&_nc_oc=Adpky0HTTxFH64UtERgKZPQLTwkHqJP2JkLv3BKsuFnGSYDrRGpND6NV9nayT0IQjmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af447Cpw66crMZZ4WXNlvssCOOvnGOpw0tRvZQVUE_hFdQ&oe=6A1DA14A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "1048298189708781", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003240_1048298193042114_5639017989450219791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_LfhsPu34WMQ7kNvwF1glaV&_nc_oc=AdpkJHF0QtBQT7n6NXUWy1sHET38K1H1J7sJyYgMf5oh76rjl31iRIeaVK1waRVBMTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ZbfBmdNJ4gpZnSfJkHKKwC5c5TuQ3Ie1X9uTjS0rNxA&oe=6A1D9C7D"}, "display_name": "VROO 360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VROO est une solution cl\u00e9-en-main pour pr\u00e9senter des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre public sur les appareils Meta Quest. Notre agence vous accompagne dans la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un programme VR parfait pour votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement !\n> S\u00e9lectionnez vos films dans notre catalogue. VROO offre plus de 30 exp\u00e9riences (Fiction, Documentaire, Exp\u00e9rimental, Nature & D\u00e9couverte, Enfants, etc.) ;\n> Lancer l\u2019application et t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez vos films en utilisant un code PIN;\n> Profitez de votre application VROO personnalis\u00e9e : Une interface simple et ergonomique en mode kiosque qui permet \u00e0 vos spectateurs de d\u00e9marrer les films en utilisant leur regard.\n\nPour plus d\u2019informations, contactez notre \u00e9quipe :  hello@diversioncinema.com\n\n\nVROO is a simple solution to showcase 360\u00b0 movies to your audience on Meta Quest devices. Our agency helps you build the perfect VR program for your event!\n> Choose your movies from our catalog. VROO offers more than 30 experiences (Fiction, Documentary, Experimental, Nature & Discovery, Kids, etc.);\n> Launch the application and download your movies using a pin code;\n> Enjoy your personalized VROO app: A simple and ergonomic interface in kiosk mode that allows your spectators to play the movies using their gaze. \nFor more information, contact our team: hello@diversioncinema.com", "short_description": "Pr\u00e9sentez des films 360\u00b0 \u00e0 votre publique en toute simplicit\u00e9 !\nThe easiest way to showcase 360 VR movies to your audience!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroo.io/Legal-Notice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Diversion cinem